\item[S2] Robert Devaney, ``Open Questions in Non-Rational Complex Dynamics'', in Ben Bielefeld and Mikhail Lyubich (eds.), Problems in Holomorphic Dynamics (1992), first problem in Section 1, pp. 35; arXiv:math/9205209v1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9205209}.
